               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>To deliver optimal data accuracy, AI306 is bundled with the PR </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>To deliver optimal data accuracy, AI306 is bundled with the PR V2.0 and is not offered as a standalone product.</photoshop:LayerText>
